Core Functional Requirements
Workspace Management

Create new workspaces with customizable names and descriptions
Edit workspace settings and metadata
Delete workspaces (with appropriate permissions)
Switch between multiple workspaces
Workspace-level permissions and access controls

User Management & Invitations

User registration and authentication
Send invitations via email or shareable links
Accept/decline workspace invitations
Role-based access control (Owner, Admin, Member, Guest)
Remove team members from workspaces
User profile management

Task Management

Create, edit, and delete tasks
Assign tasks to team members
Set task priorities, due dates, and descriptions
Task status tracking (To Do, In Progress, Review, Done)
Task dependencies and subtasks

Chat Functionality

Real-time messaging within workspaces
Channel-based conversations (general, project-specific)
Direct messaging between team members
Message history and search

Additional Suggested Features
Project Organization

Create projects/boards within workspaces
Kanban-style task boards
List and calendar views for tasks

Collaboration & Communication

Real-time notifications (in-app, email, push)
Activity feeds showing recent workspace changes


